Abang Zhang.

245
00:12:43,510 --> 00:12:44,840
Ada surat dari Nanjing?

246
00:12:49,670 --> 00:12:51,070
Tuan Muda Tian Benchang,

247
00:12:51,510 --> 00:12:53,440
