248
00:12:54,000 --> 00:12:56,240
Sejak keluarga Tian awak dipenjarakan,

249
00:12:56,240 --> 00:13:00,170
tiada sedikit pesanan pun
dari Kediaman Pegawai Pertahanan Nanjing.

250
00:13:01,390 --> 00:13:03,360
Bukankah dulu awak selalu cakap

251
