256
00:13:25,120 --> 00:13:26,120
Awak jangan lupa,

257
00:13:26,870 --> 00:13:29,530
dulu awak dah terima
banyak wang daripada saya.

258
00:13:31,000 --> 00:13:32,510
Kalau paksa saya sampai terdesak,

259
00:13:32,510 --> 00:13:36,110
saya akan cakap semuanya
apabila saya menghadiri perbicaraan.

260
00:13:38,320 --> 00:13:39,080
Abang Zhang,

261
00:13:39,360 --> 00:13:40,440
