263
00:13:41,910 --> 00:13:43,960
Pastikan serahkan kepada
Pegawai Pertahanan Wu sendiri.

264
00:13:43,960 --> 00:13:44,960
Selepas dia baca surat ini,

265
00:13:44,960 --> 00:13:46,620
