untuk menuju ke kehidupan baharu.

295
00:15:42,840 --> 00:15:45,370
Saya pun nak tengok
keadaan sebenar rumah ini

296
00:15:48,200 --> 00:15:50,600
supaya saya boleh ucapkan selamat tinggal

297
00:15:51,080 --> 00:15:52,280
dengan kediaman ini.

298
00:15:55,790 --> 00:15:58,450
Hua saya adalah
yang paling berani di dunia ini.

299
00:15:59,510 --> 00:16:01,910
Kalau begitu, kita geledah bersama-sama.

300
00:16:02,030 --> 00:16:02,550
Jom.

301
00:16:06,960 --> 00:16:07,790
Tengah minum?

302
00:16:08,840 --> 00:16:09,840
Abang Zhang.

303
00:16:10,480 --> 00:16:11,600
Siapa ini?

304
00:16:11,720 --> 00:16:12,720
Ini orang baharu.

305
00:16:47,640 --> 00:16:49,440
Tuan, sembang perlahan-lahan.

306
00:16:49,510 --> 00:16:50,080
Baik.

307
00:16:55,480 --> 00:16:56,270
Siapa awak?

308
00:17:03,700 --> 00:17:05,089
[Kediaman Pegawai Pertahanan Nanjing]

309
00:17:07,400 --> 00:17:09,400
Awak orang
Kediaman Pegawai Pertahanan Nanjing?

310
00:17:09,400 --> 00:17:11,260
Pegawai Pertahanan Wu cakap apa?

311
00:17:13,920 --> 00:17:16,160
Di mana benda awak cakap itu?

312
00:17:16,750 --> 00:17:18,280
Kalau saya cakap sekarang,

313
00:17:19,069 --> 00:17:20,400
boleh saya keluar lagi?

314
00:17:24,750 --> 00:17:26,150
Selamatkan saya keluar.

315
00:17:26,240 --> 00:17:28,840
Kalau tak mahu cakap,
awak akan mati sekarang.

316
00:17:34,510 --> 00:17:35,510
Selamatkan saya.

317
00:17:37,110 --> 00:17:38,510
Saya pasti akan serahkan

318
00:17:38,680 --> 00:17:40,290
buku akaun kepada awak sepenuhnya.

319
00:17:40,290 --> 00:17:42,690
Kalau tidak, kita binasa bersama-sama!

320
00:17:52,790 --> 00:17:53,790
Pegawai Zhang.

321
00:17:57,440 --> 00:17:58,550
Pegawai Zhang,

322
00:18:02,680 --> 00:18:03,270
Tuan.

323
00:18:07,590 --> 00:18:08,500
Kenapa ini?

324
00:18:15,590 --> 00:18:16,510
Zhen.

325
00:18:17,400 --> 00:18:18,240
Zhen.

326
00:18:22,000 --> 00:18:22,750
Zhen.

327
00:18:22,960 --> 00:18:25,220
Kita dah geledah di merata-rata tempat.

328
00:18:25,400 --> 00:18:27,030
Kalau memang ada benda penting,

329
00:18:27,030 --> 00:18:27,880
abang long saya

330
00:18:27,880 --> 00:18:30,200
dah lama sembunyikannya
di tempat lain, kan?

331
00:18:30,200 --> 00:18:31,350
Mungkin juga.

332
00:18:32,150 --> 00:18:34,200
Tapi saya ada satu keraguan.

333
00:18:34,680 --> 00:18:36,200
Beberapa hari lalu, pada saat genting,

334
00:18:36,200 --> 00:18:37,830
Tian Benchang boleh

335
00:18:38,200 --> 00:18:40,640
tiba-tiba mengeluarkan
dokumen penyeludupan itu

336
00:18:40,640 --> 00:18:42,000
dan menolak semua kesalahan

337
00:18:42,000 --> 00:18:43,550
kepada abang ngah awak.

338
00:18:44,030 --> 00:18:45,200
Jadi, biasanya

339
00:18:45,200 --> 00:18:46,270
dia pasti sentiasa berwaspada

340
00:18:46,270 --> 00:18:47,310
dan berjaga-jaga.

341
00:18:47,310 --> 00:18:48,680
Jadi, dokumen-dokumen itu

342
00:18:48,680 --> 00:18:49,640
pasti disimpan di tempat

343
00:18:49,640 --> 00:18:51,030
yang mudah dicapai.

344
00:18:51,240 --> 00:18:52,410
Jadi, setiap sudut di Kediaman Tian

345
00:18:52,410 --> 00:18:54,240
