yang macam tak pernah disentuh.

367
00:20:07,070 --> 00:20:08,070
Tunggu sebentar!

368
00:20:11,200 --> 00:20:12,440
Ada sesuatu di dalam ini.

369
00:20:12,440 --> 00:20:12,880
Ambil ke bawah.

370
00:20:12,880 --> 00:20:13,350
Baik.

371
00:20:18,110 --> 00:20:18,880
Nampak tak?

372
00:20:22,710 --> 00:20:23,880
Hua, jangan koyak!

373
00:20:24,790 --> 00:20:25,640
Takut apa?

374
00:20:25,680 --> 00:20:27,640
Pertapa Qinghe tak dapat
masuk campur urusan di sini buat masa ini.

375
00:20:27,640 --> 00:20:29,790
Dulu, dia dah membawa banyak penderitaan

376
00:20:29,790 --> 00:20:30,880
kepada keluarga awak dan Tuan Jiru.

377
00:20:30,880 --> 00:20:32,920
Memandangkan saya yang membawanya masuk,

378
00:20:32,920 --> 00:20:33,880
biarlah saya

379
00:20:34,110 --> 00:20:36,110
yang menamatkan keadaan teruk ini.

380
00:20:43,350 --> 00:20:44,280
Perlahan sikit.

381
00:20:54,960 --> 00:20:55,890
Pas perjalanan?

382
00:20:57,490 --> 00:21:00,880
[Pas perjalanan:
Dokumen sah daripada kerajaan Ming]

383
00:20:58,270 --> 00:20:59,510
Lu Wei,

384
00:21:00,880 --> 00:21:04,270
[untuk membuktikan identiti rakyat
semasa perjalanan jauh]

385
00:21:01,680 --> 00:21:04,440
