386
00:21:06,030 --> 00:21:07,110
Awak rasa

387
00:21:07,640 --> 00:21:08,840
kenapa Tian Benchang

388
00:21:09,240 --> 00:21:10,920
bersusah payah

389
00:21:11,160 --> 00:21:13,160
untuk sembunyikan pas perjalanan?

390
00:21:17,510 --> 00:21:19,400
Pengurus Zhen, Cik Tian.

391
00:21:19,790 --> 00:21:21,200
Kamu masih di dalam?

392
00:21:21,510 --> 00:21:23,160
Habislah, Tian Benchang...

393
00:21:23,440 --> 00:21:24,900
Dia dah lari dari penjara!

394
00:21:28,290 --> 00:21:29,370
Bagi saya masuk!

395
00:21:29,400 --> 00:21:30,720
Saya nak jumpa Tuan He!

396
00:21:31,030 --> 00:21:32,160
Benarkan dia masuk.

397
00:21:33,790 --> 00:21:35,160
Tuan, Tian Benchang...

398
00:21:35,160 --> 00:21:36,620
Li Zhen, tunggu sebentar.

399
00:21:43,510 --> 00:21:44,310
Teruskan.

400
00:21:46,480 --> 00:21:47,070
Tuan,

401
00:21:47,160 --> 00:21:49,720
malam ini Pegawai Zhang bawa
seorang yang tak dikenali ke penjara.

402
00:21:49,720 --> 00:21:51,880
Hamba baru nak pergi periksa,

403
00:21:52,030 --> 00:21:53,890
orang itu terus pengsankan saya.

404
00:21:54,920 --> 00:21:55,830
Zhang Guang!

405
00:21:56,200 --> 00:21:58,680
Tak sangka awak berani
pecah masuk penjara.

406
00:21:59,240 --> 00:22:00,350
Tuan,

407
00:22:00,790 --> 00:22:02,250
saya apa-apa pun tak tahu.

408
00:22:02,480 --> 00:22:04,010
Orang itu pengsankan saya.

409
00:22:04,440 --> 00:22:05,970
Apabila saya sedar semula,

410
00:22:06,000 --> 00:22:08,000
dah... dah macam ini.

411
00:22:08,240 --> 00:22:10,830
Siapa nama orang itu
dan datang dari mana?

412
00:22:11,070 --> 00:22:13,110
Saya... saya tak tahu nama dia.

413
00:22:13,790 --> 00:22:15,880
Dia... dia macam...

414
00:22:16,230 --> 00:22:17,440
Macam...

415
00:22:17,440 --> 00:22:18,240
Cakap!

416
00:22:19,640 --> 00:22:20,350
Baik.

417
00:22:21,160 --> 00:22:23,440
Dia macam dihantar
oleh Kediaman Pegawai Pertahanan Nanjing.

418
00:22:23,440 --> 00:22:24,310
Saya pernah minta orang tolong

419
00:22:24,310 --> 00:22:25,640
Tian Benchang hantar surat ke

420
00:22:25,640 --> 00:22:27,000
Kediaman Pegawai Pertahanan Nanjing.

421
00:22:27,000 --> 00:22:28,790
Tak lama lagi, orang ini pun datang.

422
00:22:28,790 --> 00:22:30,650
Katanya nak jumpa Tian Benchang.

423
00:22:32,880 --> 00:22:33,510
Tuan.

424
00:22:34,270 --> 00:22:35,240
Sebelum ini, Pegawai Pertahanan Wu

425
00:22:35,240 --> 00:22:36,950
dah lama tak pedulikan keluarga Tian.

426
00:22:36,950 --> 00:22:38,980
Tapi malam ini tiba-tiba
sanggup ambil risiko

427
00:22:38,980 --> 00:22:40,270
dengan hantar orang
untuk pecah masuk penjara,

428
00:22:40,270 --> 00:22:41,510
mesti ada sebabnya.

429
00:22:42,110 --> 00:22:43,000
Saya rasa

430
00:22:43,680 --> 00:22:44,880
mestilah Tian Benchang

431
00:22:44,880 --> 00:22:46,510
pegang kelemahan Pegawai Pertahanan Wu

432
00:22:46,510 --> 00:22:49,510
dan ugut Pegawai Pertahanan Wu
untuk selamatkannya.

433
00:22:50,480 --> 00:22:51,350
Saya tanya awak,

434
00:22:51,350 --> 00:22:53,440
apa yang tertulis dalam surat itu?

435
00:22:53,920 --> 00:22:56,310
Tertulis...

436
